Thousand Year Old Vampire (structural homage)

Thousand Year Old Vampire is a proprietary game by Tim Hutchings. Codex-w is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Tim Hutchings.

This module implements a prompt-journal play loop inspired by the *structure* of
TYOV (memory capacity, navigation, diary play). All prompt text, sheet copy, and
oracle twists in this directory are original to codex-w and are not reproduced
from the published book.

For Tim Hutchings’ official prompts and rules, use a licensed copy of Thousand
Year Old Vampire (https://thousandyearoldvampire.com/).
